  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth and Community Empowerment Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Zanzibar, Tanzania we support youth and the community by providing education resources, supporting feeding and hygiene initiatives to improve wellness, and building and renovating education facilities to improve the learning environment. Further, we teach locals how to drive boats ethically, conserve the environment, and promote ecotourism.  This fund will enable us to provide education, wellness, livelihood, and conservation programs in Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
